<title>UK: Fondo de Titulizacion sets 14.5 bln pta bond.</title>
<headline>Fondo de Titulizacion sets 14.5 bln pta bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following mortgage-backed</p>
<p>floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager J.P. Morgan</p>
<p>Securities Ltd.</p>
<p> BORROWER   FONDO DE TITULIZACION HIPOTECARIA UCI 3</p>
<p> AMT    14.05 BLN PTA BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    18.OCT.24</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +11 BP    PAY DATE</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   AAA	 ISS PRICE  PAR	 FULL FEES   0.25</p>
<p> LISTING    AIAF	DENOMS (K) =	   SALE LIMITS US/UK/ES</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   NO</p>
<p> GOV LAW    SPANISH   HOME CTRY  SPAIN     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> NOTES	THERE ARE ALSO CLASS B SUBORDINATED NOTES OF 0.45</p>
<p>		BLN PTA MATURITY OCT.24, 3M LIBOR +50 BP, AT PAR</p>
<p>		FIRST COUPON FOR BOTH TRANCHES IS OVER 2M LIBOR</p>
<p>		BANCO SANTANDER IS JOINT LEAD FOR CLASS A NOTES</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
</text>
